# Catalog query packages

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-catalog-query/SKILL.md`.

- One folder per domain: `core/database/<domain>/` (see `users/`). Functions take `*database.Catalog` and `DB()`.
- Do not add per-table files to `core/database/` or methods on `Catalog`. Domain errors stay in the table package.
- DDL still goes through catalog migrations, not query packages.
